      "id": "config:testdata/governance/v2-benchmark-baseline.json",
      "type": "config",
      "name": "v2-benchmark-baseline.json",
      "filePath": "testdata/governance/v2-benchmark-baseline.json",
      "summary": "定义治理验证的性能基准阈值，包含主机配置信息、基准版本、必需检查项（search_query、file_tree_expand、file_paginate、timeline_filter、artifact_extract 等场景的 P95 延迟阈值）以及告警/危险级别的详细场景定义，作为 CI 基准回归检查的参考基线。",
      "tags": ["governance", "benchmark", "performance", "ci-cd", "configuration"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "config:testdata/governance/v2-known-limitations.json",
      "type": "config",
      "name": "v2-known-limitations.json",
      "filePath": "testdata/governance/v2-known-limitations.json",
      "summary": "编录系统 38 条已知限制，按类别（E01、NTFS、FAT/exFAT、ext4、XFS、Btrfs、APFS、HFS+、Linux 构件、macOS 构件等）组织，每项包含状态、摘要、受影响的处理链和源文档引用，供治理脚本用于跟踪已确认的能力缺口。",
      "tags": ["governance", "known-limitations", "documentation", "quality-assurance", "configuration"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "config:testdata/governance/v2-release-policy.json",
      "type": "config",
      "name": "v2-release-policy.json",
      "filePath": "testdata/governance/v2-release-policy.json",
      "summary": "定义发布质量策略，包括核心 fixture 处理链（E01、RAW、NTFS、Prefetch、LNK、Registry、RecycleBin）、构件关联分析系列、基准残余风险清单以及通过/失败/部分通过的评分规则，作为发布就绪评估的策略文件。",
      "tags": ["governance", "release-policy", "quality-assurance", "scoring", "configuration"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    },
    {
      "id": "config:testdata/governance/v2-runtime-results.json",
      "type": "config",
      "name": "v2-runtime-results.json",
      "filePath": "testdata/governance/v2-runtime-results.json",
      "summary": "捕获自动化治理脚本的运行验证结果，涵盖文档漂移检查（README/AGENTS 事实同步、已知限制表格对齐）、核心 fixture 回归测试、基准阈值合规性和安全基线检查，每项含通过/失败状态和证据详情。",
      "tags": ["governance", "runtime-results", "verification", "audit", "configuration"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "config:testdata/governance/v2-security-taxonomy.json",
      "type": "config",
      "name": "v2-security-taxonomy.json",
      "filePath": "testdata/governance/v2-security-taxonomy.json",
      "summary": "定义安全默认策略（导出覆盖保护、路径守卫、stdio 白名单、SSE 仅 HTTPS、内嵌凭据拦截、媒体句柄作用域、错误脱敏），依赖安全严重性分级（Critical/High/Medium/Low 含 CVSS 范围与响应 SLA），以及错误分类条目到缓解策略的映射。",
      "tags": ["governance", "security", "dependency-security", "taxonomy", "configuration"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "config:testdata/governance/v2-verification-catalog.json",
      "type": "config",
      "name": "v2-verification-catalog.json",
      "filePath": "testdata/governance/v2-verification-catalog.json",
      "summary": "全面的验证处理链编目，列出每个证据/构件处理链（E01、RAW、NTFS、FAT、exFAT、ext4、XFS、Btrfs、APFS、HFS+、Prefetch、LNK、Registry、RecycleBin、EVTX 等）的平台、成熟度、保证级别、fixture 层级、已验证样本数量和详细备注，是已验证能力的总体目录。",
      "tags": ["governance", "verification", "evidence-chain", "catalog", "configuration"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    }
